Depends: libc6, libgcc-s1, libstdc++6, libcurl4t64, libssl3t64, libnuma1, zlib1g, libzstd1, systemd, libmsquic (= 2.5.11)
Description: Explicit Linux Reach host service
 A bounded QUIC-v1/TLS-1.3 ReachWire listener backed by an operator-managed
 numeric-loopback EXO endpoint. Installation is inert.
